,"name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-08-06T11:52:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T06:34:12Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T00:21:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122166","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122166.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122166.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-11T00:21:26Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- `ScriptLanguage` did have both `get_recognized_extensions` and `get_extension` (both dating back to GODOT IS OPEN SOURCE), which is duplication in the API. `get_extension` is used far more often. In practice that means, that while it was technically possible to return multiple extensions from one of them, there never was support for that usecase, since `get_recognized_extensions` is only used in the script create dialog.\r\n\r\nThis PR updates the two usages of `get_recognized_extensions` to use `get_extension` instead and removes the method.\r\n\r\nIn case someone is wondering about compat, the only behavior change is in the script create dialogue. Also the dialog did already use `get_extension` for validation, so a secondary extension that was in `get_recognized_extensions` could never have been used. The changes in behaviour are thus limited to:\r\n- when using a path with a secondary extension the error message will now say `Invalid extension.` instead of `Extension doesn't match chosen language.`\r\n- Secondary extensions will not be accepted by the file picker dialogue, previously you could select them and validation would fail after that.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nMoving this method to `EditorLanguage` is not an option since it is used in debugger related code, and debug functionality should stay in `ScriptLanguage`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122166/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122166/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}